  Optional: Google Apps Script webhook (save airdrop leads to Google Sheet)
  ---------------------
  1) Create a new App Script, paste this, Deploy as web app (Anyone can access):

  function doPost(e){
    const ss = SpreadsheetApp.openById('YOUR_SHEET_ID');
    const sh = ss.getSheetByName('Leads')||ss.insertSheet('Leads');
    const data = JSON.parse(e.postData.contents||'{}');
    sh.appendRow([new Date(), data.username]);
    return ContentService.createTextOutput('ok').setMimeType(ContentService.MimeType.TEXT);
  }

  2) In index.html fetch:
     fetch('YOUR_WEBAPP_URL',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({username:u})})
  --></html>
